re software, and plugins, a robust database of WordPress tutorials, friendly support, and more.",ko="You can set up subdomains from aliases as well as the primary domain. Additionally, subdomains may be ‘pointed’ to any subdirectory in the hosting account.",hn="Create up to 100 domain-based email addresses and forwarders at no-cost. This feature comes with a friendly webmail interface where you can manage your accounts, create forwarders, autoresponders, and more. With this plan, you get a separate email service storage limit of 1GB per mailbox.",Xa="Object caching is a process that stores database query results in order to quickly bring them back up the next time they are needed. This can reduce WordPress website response times up to 3 times.",ss="Protect your website's data from accidents. We keep daily backups of the last 7 days and weekly backups of the last 7 weeks. A full backup restore is the fastest way to restore your site and limit the effects of website downtime on your site traffic.",Ti="Protect your website's data from accidents. We keep daily backups of the last 7 days and weekly backups of the last 7 weeks. A full backup restore is the fastest way to restore your site and limit the effects of website downtime on your site traffic.",yc="Protect your website data with automatic daily and on-demand backups. Daily backups are stored for 7 days, and weekly backups are stored for 7 weeks.",Qg="v2.purchase.plan.daily.automatic.backups.tooltip",Ys="Seamlessly safeguard your site with pre-update backups and customizable security adjustments, ensuring a balance between protection and stability, all effortlessly managed by our system.",Ru="The amount of CPU power given to the server.",br="Make the most of your web hosting without worrying whether your site’s traffic exceeds bandwidth limits. You can transfer as much data as you need to build an online presence for your business. Although all uses of hosting services provided by Hostinger are subject to our Terms of Service, we hope you will use bandwidth only for the regular operation of a personal or small to medium business website.",ds="Increased security: With a dedicated IP address, you are less likely to be affected by security issues on other websites that share your IP address.</br>Improved email deliverability: Some email providers may block emails coming from shared IP addresses due to the increased risk of spam. Having a dedicated IP address can improve the deliverability of emails sent from your website.</br>Enhanced control: With a dedicated IP address, you have more control over your hosting environment, which can be useful for certain types of websites or applications.",uQ="Get more speed, better SEO, visitor retention and conversions with our custom-built WP optimization stack and LiteSpeed cache.",Wc="The amount of allocated storage space on high speed Solid State Drives (SSDs).",jL="You can transfer as much data as you need to build an online presence for your business. Although all uses of hosting services provided by Hostinger are subject to our Terms of Service, we hope you will use bandwidth only for the regular operation of a personal or small to medium business website.",zL="You can transfer as much data as you need to build an online presence for your business. Although all uses of hosting services provided by Hostinger are subject to our Terms of Service, we hope you will use bandwidth only for the regular operation of a personal or small to medium business website.",vi="Migration: We will move your website to Hostinger from another hosting provider for free.",Ou="Register a domain for free for one year when purchasing a yearly (or longer) hosting plan. Additional terms apply, as not all TLDs are eligible for this promotion. Free domain must be registered within 12 months of acquiring the hosting plan, or it will be cancelled.",Un="Hostinger's CDN (Content Delivery Network) optimizes website speed by caching content on multiple servers globally and delivering it from the visitor's nearest location, resulting in up to 40% faster loading times. Hostinger CDN comes with built-in static website caching, cache purging, CSS and JavaScript minification, data center rerouting, CDN bypass mode, and other website security features.",ts="Our in-house developed AI tools help you create unique content for your website. Simply describe what you need, and publish your website fast. Image tool coming soon.",wE="Amount of requests that can be served simultaneously by web server",Qa="Items that correspond to the number of files and folders you have on your account",nd="Recommended for most WooCommerce stores with up to 1 000 product listings and 500 orders/month. Multiple 3rd party (stock management, order fulfilling, invoicing software, reporting) integrations.",dQ="Supports stores that sell up to 100 products, with features such as standard product types, a single language storefront, a single payment gateway, and simple shipping calculation logic.",Kr="v2.hosting.perk.woocommerce.starter.tooltip",rd="v2.hosting.perk.woocommerce.basic.tooltip",id="Recommended for advanced WooCommerce stores with up to 2 000 product listings and 1 000 orders/month. Multiple 3rd party (stock management, order fulfilling, invoicing software, reporting) integrations.",fr="Recommended WooCommerce stores that require maximum performance. Up to 5 000 product listings and 10 000 orders/month. Multiple 3rd party (stock management, order fulfilling, invoicing software, reporting) integrations.",Jg="v2.website.builder.website.count.tooltip",eh="v2.website.builder.free.email.tooltip",fl="v2.website.builder.free.domain.tooltip.v2",Pl="We care about clients' success. Contact our customer support via our 24/7 live chat.",Qi="v2.website.builder.marketing.integrations.tooltip",Nl="Buy our services risk-free and try it with peace of mind. If something goes wrong, you can get a full refund of your hosting fees (excluding domain registration fees) within 30 days of purchasing a plan.",_Q="Create, edit, publish and maintain your website seamlessly on both mobile and desktop devices. Make changes to your site on the go, ensuring it's always up to date.",cE="Al Website Builder enables you to launch a website in minutes. Answer three questions, and Al Website Builder creates your site with SEO-friendly content, unique copy, and fitting images. Take it a step further by personalizing your site using drag-and-drop editor.",fu="v2.website.builder.ai.image.generator.tooltip",Dl="Sell up to 500 products, manage orders and stocks, set up shipping options, and enable appointment bookings conveniently in one place.",Pu="v2.website.builder.transaction.fees.tooltip",Ji="v2.website.builder.payment.methods.tooltip",CN="v2.website.builder.ai.tools.tooltip",bN="v2.website.builder.online.store.tooltip",yN="v2.website.builder.ai.product.generator.tooltip",LN="v2.purchase.perks.domain.only.upsell.perks.website.builder.tooltip",Bs="PHP workers are directly responsible for loading products, processing orders, and handling customer requests. The more PHP workers available, the faster and more efficiently these tasks are performed, leading to a better shopping experience for customers.",In="This limit specifies maximum number of simultaneous connections to database.",Nu="Scans your site and alerts about vulnerabilities in the WordPress core software, plugins and themes.",Lc="We use LiteSpeed Cache for WordPress (LSCWP). It uses server-level cache with optimization features and can greatly improve website loading time.",pQ="LiteSpeed Cache + Object Cache for WordPress. The LiteSpeed object caching system stores database query results and retrieves the information from the cache instead of reloading it.",Cl="A variety of ready-to-go customizable website templates to help you get started.",Du="Automatic compatibility checks provide preventive solutions to issues that could otherwise result in sites crashing or slowing down.",th="Shield your DNS infrastructure from DDoS attacks. Cloudflare DNS firewall protects our nameservers, and it has the same DDoS protection that has mitigated some of the largest DDoS attacks to date. When malicious traffic is aimed at our origin nameservers, Cloudflare’s DDoS protection reroutes that traffic and absorbs it across global networks. That means your website will be available and traffic continues to flow, even when your origin nameservers are compromised.",ah="Collaborate efficiently on your web hosting account. With this tool, you can manage privileges for others to access your web hosting account (or just specific services).",Cu="Maximize your presence online. We keep our annual uptime rates at a 99.9% height to ensure accessibility of your website at all times. When your website’s down, that’s a potentially missed opportunity to engage with a customer (or potential customer). That’s why we guarantee you one of the best service uptimes globally.",bu="Schedule commands or scripts on a server, and run them periodically at fixed times, dates, or intervals.",yu="Use the Git source control system to handle every project with speed and efficiency. We integrated it in our hosting plans to allow you to create repositories of your website, which you can later access, download, edit, and auto-deploy on multiple local branches using Git.",Lu="Switch to your desired version of PHP in just one click. We support versions all the way from PHP 7.3 to the latest version of PHP 8.3.",wu="Be in charge of your records. Hostinger allows you to edit domain name system (DNS), including A, CNAME, MX, NS and other kinds of records.",Mu="A custom built caching solution that enables faster website load times and increased speed.",ku="A custom-developed control panel built to maximize the potential of your website and service provided for you.",Hu="Use SSH to protect your communication with the remote server. It provides a secure encrypted connection to your account to easily manage massive files and even databases. It serves to administrators and web developers to enable direct secure access to their hosting account on the web server. With SSH enabled, you can also take advantage of SFTP for secure file access, transfer, and management.",oh="Straightforward connection to Amazon API.",Mr="v2.each.mailbox.comes.with.1.gb.of.storage",wN="v2.purchase.perks.domain.only.upsell.perks.mailboxes.tooltip",sh="v2.purchase.plan.free.domain",Uu="v2.purchase.plan.free.cdn",sc="v2.purchase.plan.exclusive.ip",nh="v2.purchase.plan.access.per.website.tooltip",rh="v2.purchase.plan.full.website.isolation.tooltip",ih="v2.purchase.plan.custom.php.application.tooltip",ch="v2.purchase.plan.email.for.one.year.tooltip",lh="v2.purchase.plan.thirty.day.guarantee.tooltip",mQ="v2.purchase.plan.summary.perks.ssl.tooltip",EQ="v2.purchase.plan.summary.perks.free.domain.tooltip",IQ="v2.purchase.plan.summary.perks.ai.agent.tooltip",SQ="v2.purchase.plan.summary.perks.cdn.tooltip",Js="v2.hosting.perk.nodejs.web.apps.tooltip";s.PlanSlug.STARTER+"",s.Perks.SINGLE_WEBSITE,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.SUBDOMAIN,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.SHARED_IP_ADDRESS,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.STORAGE,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.VISITORS,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.WEEKLY_BACKUPS,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.ONE_FREE_EMAIL_ACCOUNT,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.ONE_FREE_FTP_ACCOUNT,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.SSL,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.BUILDER,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.WP_MANAGED,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.NOT_OPTIMIZED_FOR_WOOCOMMERCE,s.PerkStatus.DANGER,s.Perks.WP_STAGING,s.PerkStatus.DANGER,s.Perks.OBJECT_CACHE,s.PerkStatus.DANGER,s.PlanSlug.PREMIUM+"",s.Perks.SINGLE_WEBSITE,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.SUBDOMAIN,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.SHARED_IP_ADDRESS,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.STORAGE,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.VISITORS,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.WEEKLY_BACKUPS,s.PerkStatus.WARNING,s.Perks.FREE_EMAIL,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.FTP,s.PerkStatus.SUCCESS,s.Perks.SSL,s.PerkStatus.